{"ticker":"MA","updated":"2026-10-23T23:15:51Z","profile":{"longName":"Mastercard Incorporated","shortName":"Mastercard Incorporated","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Credit Services","country":"United States","website":"https://www.mastercard.com","fullTimeEmployees":39800,"marketCap":546279751680,"trailingPE":34.30143,"forwardPE":27.03265,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":15.571067,"pegRatio":1.65,"targetMeanPrice":676.0381,"targetHighPrice":765.0,"targetLowPrice":550.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":37,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.141,"earningsGrowth":0.221,"grossMargins":1.0,"operatingMargins":0.61108,"profitMargins":0.46339,"totalRevenue":35083001856,"beta":0.76,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":633.29,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":464.52,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.55},"summary":"Mastercard Incorporated, a technology company, provides transaction processing and other payment-related products and services in the United States and internationally. The company offers products and services for account holders, merchants, financial institutions, digital partners, businesses, governments, and other organizations, such as programs that enable issuers to provide consumers with credits to defer payments; payment products and solutions that allow its customers to access funds in deposit and other accounts; prepaid programs services; consumer bill payment services; and commercial credit, debit, and prepaid payment products and solutions. It also provides solutions that enable businesses or governments to make payments to businesses, including Virtual Card Number, which is generated dynamically from an existing account and leverages the credit limit of the funding account; and a platform to optimize supplier payment enablement campaigns for financial institutions. In addition, the company offers Mastercard Move, which partners with digital messaging and payment platforms to enable consumers to send money directly within applications to other consumers; and partners with central banks, fintechs, and financial institutions, as well as enables various cross-border payment flows. Further, it provides security solutions; marketing, personalization, and issuer and mercha","summary_zh":"萬事達卡公司是一家科技公司，在美國和國際上提供交易處理和其他支付相關產品和服務。該公司為帳戶持有人、商家、金融機構、數位合作夥伴、企業、政府和其他組織提供產品和服務，例如使發行人能夠向消費者提供信用以推遲付款的計劃；允許客戶提取存款和其他帳戶資金的支付產品和解決方案；預付節目服務；消費者帳單支付服務；以及商業信貸、金融卡和預付支付產品和解決方案。它還提供使企業或政府能夠向企業付款的解決方案，包括虛擬卡號，該卡號是從現有帳戶動態生成的，並利用資金帳戶的信用額度；以及一個優化金融機構供應商支付支援活動的平台。此外，該公司還提供 Mastercard Move，它與數位訊息和支付平台合作，使消費者能夠在應用程式內直接向其他消費者匯款；並與中央銀行、金融科技公司和金融機構合作，並實現各種跨境支付流程。此外，它還提供安全解決方案；行銷、個人化以及發行人和商品","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"信用服務","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":597.82,"h":599.04,"l":592.86,"c":593.21,"v":1984300},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":593.08,"h":596.0,"l":586.29,"c":591.61,"v":4774600},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":591.21,"h":594.62,"l":589.82,"c":590.66,"v":1480900},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":590.82,"h":593.53,"l":589.72,"c":590.48,"v":2159800},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":592.0,"h":596.83,"l":590.26,"c":595.29,"v":2111200},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":595.62,"h":595.62,"l":586.0,"c":591.87,"v":2284500},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":591.83,"h":594.0,"l":588.96,"c":593.28,"v":1959400},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":593.03,"h":595.89,"l":589.29,"c":595.64,"v":1653700},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":595.47,"h":598.58,"l":579.03,"c":584.22,"v":2432100},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":582.62,"h":589.79,"l":580.7,"c":586.6,"v":1948200},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":583.54,"h":591.18,"l":583.3,"c":584.0,"v":2266000},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":582.13,"h":582.13,"l":571.0,"c":579.38,"v":2535200},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":580.88,"h":589.97,"l":580.01,"c":588.73,"v":2407000},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":586.44,"h":589.21,"l":580.0,"c":580.41,"v":2242800},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":582.73,"h":586.5,"l":581.5,"c":582.96,"v":2222600},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":578.01,"h":588.11,"l":576.83,"c":586.42,"v":2537000},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":587.71,"h":598.89,"l":587.44,"c":598.63,"v":2930800},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":596.08,"h":601.62,"l":585.88,